{"word":"shading","ipa":"ˈʃeɪdɪŋ","persianMeaning":"سایه‌زنی، تیره‌کاری، تدریج، گذار نرم، سایه انداختن، پوشاندن، نمایش اثر سایه یا تیرگی","englishDefinition":"graded markings that indicate light or shaded areas in a drawing or painting","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The artist used careful shading to create depth and dimension in the portrait.","examplePersian":"هنرمند از تکنیک سایه‌زنی برای نشان دادن عمق استفاده کرد.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Low","toeflRelevance":"Low","greRelevance":"Low","tags":["General","CEFR","offline","Openjam","needs-collocation"],"source":"Openjam + ECDICT + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"Openjam MIT; ECDICT MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":19695,"examPriority":0,"learningOrder":5496}
{"word":"sonar","ipa":"ˈsoʊnɑr","persianMeaning":"سونار (دستگاه اندازه‌گیری صوتی زیرآبی)","englishDefinition":"a measuring instrument that sends out an acoustic pulse in water and measures distances in terms of the time for the echo of the pulse to return","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"sonar is an acronym for sound navigation ranging","examplePersian":"کشتی‌ها از سونار برای یافتن ماهی‌ها و مانع‌های زیر آب استفاده می‌کنند.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Low","toeflRelevance":"Low","greRelevance":"Low","tags":["General","CEFR","offline","Openjam","needs-collocation"],"source":"Openjam + ECDICT + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"Openjam MIT; ECDICT MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":19702,"examPriority":0,"learningOrder":5497}
{"word":"spat","ipa":"spæt","persianMeaning":"نزاع کوچک، دعوای جزئی، پوتین یا جوراب دراز تا مچ پا، ریزش مانند قطرات باران، به طور دائم چسبیده شدن","englishDefinition":"a quarrel about petty points","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"They had a spat about whose turn it was to do the dishes.","examplePersian":"آنها بر سر یک موضوع کوچک با هم تخاصم کردند.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Low","toeflRelevance":"Low","greRelevance":"Low","tags":["General","CEFR","offline","Openjam","needs-collocation"],"source":"Openjam + ECDICT + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"Openjam MIT; ECDICT MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":19703,"examPriority":0,"learningOrder":5498}
