{"word":"starch","ipa":"stɑrʧ","persianMeaning":"نشاسته، ماده سفت‌کننده لباس","englishDefinition":"a complex carbohydrate found chiefly in seeds, fruits, tubers, roots and stem pith of plants, notably in corn, potatoes, wheat, and rice; an important foodstuff and used otherwise especially in adhesives and as fillers and stiffeners for paper and textiles","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"Potatoes and rice are both excellent sources of starch for energy.","examplePersian":"نشاسته یکی از کربوهیدرات‌های مهم در غلات و سیب‌زمینی است.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Low","toeflRelevance":"Low","greRelevance":"Low","tags":["General","CEFR","offline","Openjam","needs-collocation"],"source":"Openjam + ECDICT + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"Openjam MIT; ECDICT MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":19706,"examPriority":0,"learningOrder":5500}
